{"ts":1793369972311,"event":"done","summary":"Renamed billingUrl to billingEndpoint (same value) across shared config and all consumers. Shipped: PR #1 contracts 1.0.0 -> 2.0.0 (breaking, major bump because the key was removed); PR #2 core-shell, PR #3 sub-route-billing, PR #4 sub-route-reports, each moved to @mfe/shared-contracts ^2.0.0 with lockfile updated and the reference renamed. All merged, CI and CD green. Assumptions: 2.0.0 is the right bump for a removed key; the old billingUrl key was dropped (not kept as an alias) because the acceptance criteria require no remaining references; the shell's internal billingEndpointHint key was left as-is since it is not billingUrl; platform-kit was not touched because nothing referenced billingUrl there."}
